WEBVTT

00:53.930 --> 00:55.460
[Money]

00:55.490 --> 00:58.280
[Children]

00:58.320 --> 01:00.840
[Official]

01:00.860 --> 01:03.360
[Blessing]

01:10.400 --> 01:11.530
Whoever wrote this,

01:11.610 --> 01:13.539
follow them to see where they live.

01:25.840 --> 01:26.930
Who wrote this?

01:26.250 --> 01:27.970
[The Zhang family
will die a horrible death!]

01:28.000 --> 01:30.180
[Fortune Telling]

01:30.210 --> 01:32.570
[Li Yingjuan]

01:45.120 --> 01:46.810
Wish you longevity.

01:47.400 --> 01:48.640
Are you here for divination

01:48.640 --> 01:49.920
or for the talisman?

01:50.039 --> 01:50.840
Master,

01:50.920 --> 01:51.870
my surname is Li.

01:52.070 --> 01:54.150
I want to invite you to my house
to perform a ritual.

01:54.150 --> 01:55.120
Sure.

01:55.240 --> 01:56.190
What is it for?

01:56.470 --> 01:58.330
My niece is getting married soon.

01:58.550 --> 01:59.470
To read their Four Pillars of Destiny?

01:59.470 --> 02:00.280
No problem.

02:00.830 --> 02:01.600
No, no.

02:01.600 --> 02:03.730
I want you to come to my house and help me

02:04.160 --> 02:05.550
break them up.

02:05.640 --> 02:06.470
Well...

02:06.750 --> 02:08.039
It's better to destroy ten temples

02:08.039 --> 02:09.270
than one marriage.

02:09.430 --> 02:10.320
Please

02:10.520 --> 02:12.110
don't make it difficult for me.

02:12.110 --> 02:14.370
None of the Zhang family are good people!

02:18.710 --> 02:20.430
They want to kill my niece.

02:21.540 --> 02:23.050
They want to...

02:23.079 --> 02:24.600
trap her soul.

02:25.870 --> 02:27.920
She's my only relative left.

02:27.920 --> 02:29.240
I can't watch her

02:29.240 --> 02:30.960
jump into a fire pit.

02:31.110 --> 02:32.800
Why won't she listen to me?

02:32.800 --> 02:34.670
She thinks I'm trying to harm her!

02:34.670 --> 02:36.079
How could I...

02:36.210 --> 02:38.020
I have indeed heard of

02:38.050 --> 02:40.520
the soul-trapping ritual
to change one's fate.

02:40.520 --> 02:42.320
But this ritual is extremely wicked

02:42.320 --> 02:43.760
and rarely done.

02:43.960 --> 02:44.800
Ma'am,

02:45.670 --> 02:47.040
how can you be sure

02:47.200 --> 02:49.079
that family did this ritual?

02:49.920 --> 02:50.829
Because

02:52.590 --> 02:53.430
our Li family

02:56.670 --> 02:58.360
did it before.

02:59.110 --> 03:01.200
The one trapped was from the Zhang family.

03:01.200 --> 03:02.670
What a sin.

03:02.920 --> 03:04.430
If we keep repaying one wrong
with another,

03:04.430 --> 03:06.390
when will this cycle of vengeance
ever end?

03:06.390 --> 03:07.480
So...

03:09.240 --> 03:09.760
Master,

03:09.990 --> 03:10.760
please,

03:10.760 --> 03:11.550
help me.

03:11.710 --> 03:12.240
Alright?

03:12.240 --> 03:13.670
We are willing to pay any amount.

03:13.670 --> 03:15.070
It's not about the money.

03:15.480 --> 03:17.010
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

03:17.360 --> 03:19.710
We've been exorcising demons for 20 years.

03:19.710 --> 03:20.760
We know our craft,

03:20.760 --> 03:22.079
and we get results.

03:22.360 --> 03:24.590
We'll take your case.

03:25.590 --> 03:26.079
Thank you!

03:26.079 --> 03:27.079
Thank you, Master!

03:27.079 --> 03:27.670
Thank you so much!

03:27.670 --> 03:28.670
Thank you so much!

03:28.670 --> 03:30.240
Then we are saved!

03:30.240 --> 03:31.320
Thank you.

03:31.320 --> 03:32.550
Thank you, Master.

03:32.800 --> 03:34.040
Thank you.

03:35.270 --> 03:36.390
Thank you.

03:40.110 --> 03:41.320
The Zhang family is where they are today

03:41.320 --> 03:44.480
because the soul-trapping ritual
boosted their business.

03:44.480 --> 03:46.390
They hired an evil Taoist
to perform the ritual.

03:46.390 --> 03:48.360
Once our Li Ling
marries into their family,

03:48.360 --> 03:50.240
they will stuff her alive into a vat

03:50.240 --> 03:52.760
full of talisman water

03:53.240 --> 03:55.480
to trap her soul,

03:55.480 --> 03:57.670
so she can never be reincarnated.

04:00.870 --> 04:02.800
Have you heard of
the soul-trapping ritual?

04:02.800 --> 04:04.630
I've heard of it, but never seen it.

04:04.630 --> 04:05.620
That requires killing.

04:05.620 --> 04:06.750
But we don't do that.

04:08.600 --> 04:09.930
Let's take a look first.

04:57.790 --> 04:58.909
Come on.

04:59.000 --> 05:00.390
There's nothing here.

05:00.560 --> 05:01.820
That old lady was so weird.

05:01.820 --> 05:04.190
I guess she has a problem here.

07:25.670 --> 07:29.500
[A Prophet]

07:30.170 --> 07:32.640
[Episode 19]

07:33.640 --> 07:34.880
You think I can't catch you?

07:34.880 --> 07:36.270
You little thing!

07:39.790 --> 07:40.880
If I catch you,

07:40.880 --> 07:42.390
I'll make you into

07:42.390 --> 07:43.830
spicy chicken!

07:49.560 --> 07:51.030
You really made me angry.

07:51.030 --> 07:51.960
I'm telling you.

08:00.210 --> 08:00.970
Oh my.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.600
It's the Sect Master's room.

08:08.120 --> 08:09.560
Why is there a coffin?

08:14.250 --> 08:18.380
[Tomb of Shangguan Chengming]

08:15.440 --> 08:16.270
Shang...

08:17.590 --> 08:18.790
Four character‌s?

08:18.880 --> 08:19.910
Who is it?

08:20.230 --> 08:20.830
Master.

08:25.760 --> 08:26.440
Master.

08:26.640 --> 08:27.520
I put it here.

08:28.830 --> 08:29.640
This thing

08:29.640 --> 08:30.350
was...

08:30.420 --> 08:32.549
brought from Pangzhou by Chief Batou.

08:33.110 --> 08:34.309
It was a long journey.

08:34.409 --> 08:36.570
I'm afraid someone tampered with it.

08:37.230 --> 08:39.159
How about we open it and take a look?

08:42.110 --> 08:42.870
No rush.

08:44.440 --> 08:45.710
Shangguan Chengming.

08:47.710 --> 08:49.840
Do you think this Shangguan Chengming

08:50.470 --> 08:51.830
could be my son?

08:52.200 --> 08:53.280
To be honest,

08:53.630 --> 08:56.080
this kid doesn't look like you at all.

08:57.080 --> 08:58.610
I don't think he's your son.

08:59.710 --> 09:01.110
It's so mysterious.

09:03.870 --> 09:05.320
Did Li Yingjuan find him?

09:05.630 --> 09:06.630
They...

09:11.440 --> 09:12.160
Didn't you hear that?

09:12.160 --> 09:13.280
That was a rooster crowing.

09:13.280 --> 09:13.800
Let's go.

09:13.800 --> 09:15.280
Let's talk inside.

09:16.800 --> 09:18.800
Where did this chicken come from?

09:37.590 --> 09:38.920
Are you keeping a vigil?

09:41.470 --> 09:42.920
You didn't sleep all night?

09:42.920 --> 09:43.680
I did.

09:44.520 --> 09:45.870
Just couldn't fall asleep.

09:45.870 --> 09:46.750
What's wrong?

09:47.470 --> 09:48.280
Something on your mind?

09:48.280 --> 09:49.110
No.

09:49.350 --> 09:49.960
Nothing at all.

09:49.960 --> 09:51.560
Then why are you sitting
on my bed holding a chicken?

09:51.560 --> 09:53.350
It's my guardian now.

09:55.040 --> 09:56.040
Then keep your guardian away from me.

09:56.040 --> 09:56.710
No can do.

09:57.400 --> 09:58.990
I'm counting on it to make me some money

09:58.990 --> 10:00.160
so I can get a wife.

10:01.320 --> 10:02.710
Do you even have a girlfriend?

10:02.710 --> 10:03.960
Talking about getting a wife.

10:03.960 --> 10:05.350
Of course I do.

10:05.710 --> 10:07.560
We've been together for a while now.

10:07.560 --> 10:09.280
How come I've never seen her?

10:09.710 --> 10:10.510
Is she a fairy?

10:10.870 --> 10:11.920
Nonsense.

10:11.920 --> 10:12.800
So you don't have one!

10:12.800 --> 10:13.510
I do!

10:13.510 --> 10:14.510
I might as well tell you,

10:14.510 --> 10:15.560
her name is Liu Xijiao.

10:15.560 --> 10:16.870
She really looks like a fairy,

10:16.870 --> 10:18.400
like the ones in the murals.

10:18.400 --> 10:19.440
When she was standing there,

10:19.440 --> 10:20.230
Chen, who sells jelly noodles,

10:20.230 --> 10:21.630
couldn't even take his eyes off her.

10:21.630 --> 10:22.280
It's rea—

10:23.040 --> 10:24.200
Master!

10:25.400 --> 10:26.190
Master!

10:26.210 --> 10:28.010
Sounds like that crazy old lady.

10:29.830 --> 10:31.110
Don't move. I'll go.

10:31.110 --> 10:32.510
Watch my guardian for me.

10:36.400 --> 10:37.680
Shangguan Chengming.

10:39.080 --> 10:40.510
I've been thinking,

10:40.710 --> 10:43.110
you shouldn't be running scams these days.

10:43.230 --> 10:44.440
Just lay low.

10:55.040 --> 10:56.160
Master!

10:56.160 --> 10:57.350
Coming.

10:59.320 --> 10:59.830
Master!

10:59.830 --> 11:00.350
Ma'am.

11:00.350 --> 11:01.200
Look!

11:01.200 --> 11:02.400
Look at my arms.

11:02.400 --> 11:03.960
My niece and I are both like this.

11:03.960 --> 11:05.510
We were scratched by ghosts!

11:05.510 --> 11:07.230
The Zhang family must be trying
to trap our souls.

11:07.230 --> 11:09.470
They want to take our souls away!

11:09.750 --> 11:10.990
What should we do?

11:10.990 --> 11:13.440
This is quite serious.

11:13.630 --> 11:16.280
As they say, only a century-old evil ghost

11:16.280 --> 11:19.080
can show its form.

11:19.080 --> 11:20.350
What should we do?

11:20.350 --> 11:21.630
Master, please save us!

11:21.630 --> 11:23.160
Please save us!

11:23.160 --> 11:24.440
Don't panic.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.800
Don't panic.

11:25.800 --> 11:26.560
This indeed

11:26.560 --> 11:28.960
can't be cured
with just a few doses of medicine.

11:28.960 --> 11:31.200
I need to go to your residence

11:31.320 --> 11:33.800
and perform an exorcism
for the whole house.

11:34.440 --> 11:35.200
Here's the plan.

11:35.200 --> 11:37.510
I'll go get some
evil-warding artifacts first.

11:37.510 --> 11:38.280
Wait for me here.

11:38.280 --> 11:38.920
I'll be right back.

11:38.920 --> 11:39.560
Okay.

11:39.560 --> 11:40.710
Okay, Master.

11:44.710 --> 11:45.800
What are you doing?

11:45.920 --> 11:48.990
I can handle this scam myself.

11:49.020 --> 11:50.620
Sit down.

11:54.200 --> 11:54.990
But honestly,

11:54.990 --> 11:56.990
I really can't handle

11:56.990 --> 11:59.040
this situation.

11:59.280 --> 12:00.750
You gotta help me.

12:00.750 --> 12:01.750
I'm telling you,

12:01.750 --> 12:03.710
the scratches on that old lady's arm...

12:03.710 --> 12:05.800
I heard you guys talking just now.

12:05.920 --> 12:06.920
That old lady

12:07.280 --> 12:08.510
was bitten by a bug.

12:08.510 --> 12:09.470
A bug?

12:10.150 --> 12:11.640
There's a bug called the Ghost Crawler.

12:11.640 --> 12:13.570
Its bite marks look just like that.

12:14.000 --> 12:15.170
But

12:15.190 --> 12:17.320
these bugs don't usually appear indoors.

12:17.320 --> 12:19.920
Maybe someone is playing tricks.

12:20.230 --> 12:21.400
Whether someone is playing tricks or not,

12:21.400 --> 12:22.590
I've already taken the money.

12:22.590 --> 12:24.230
I have to fix this for her.

12:24.560 --> 12:25.890
What am I supposed to do?

12:30.080 --> 12:31.210
What does this mean?

12:45.710 --> 12:47.230
Spirits of heaven,

12:47.680 --> 12:48.990
spirits of earth,

12:49.160 --> 12:51.280
demons and monsters, hear my decree.

12:51.960 --> 12:54.360
Dogs bark in the east,
cats meow in the west,

12:54.400 --> 12:56.830
the Day-Wandering God knows best.

12:56.990 --> 12:59.400
Copper bells pin down the headless demon!

13:00.680 --> 13:04.040
Incense ash mixed with wine
breaks the spell.

13:18.400 --> 13:19.200
Open!

13:29.210 --> 13:30.130
Aunt!

13:30.400 --> 13:31.920
Why did you bring another scammer home?

13:31.920 --> 13:33.830
Look at this place. It's a smoky mess.

13:33.830 --> 13:34.400
Oh my!

13:34.400 --> 13:35.590
Stop talking nonsense!

13:35.590 --> 13:36.990
You are being too rude!

13:36.990 --> 13:39.110
Master, please don't mind her.

13:40.040 --> 13:40.800
Look,

13:40.800 --> 13:41.590
Master.

13:41.590 --> 13:42.750
Look at her arm.

13:42.750 --> 13:44.200
Look at her legs!

13:44.200 --> 13:45.350
Aunt, I study medicine.

13:44.940 --> 13:47.440
[Li Ling]

13:45.350 --> 13:46.590
How could I not know this?

13:46.590 --> 13:47.800
These are just bug bites.

13:47.800 --> 13:50.040
How could I not know
if they are bug bites or not?

13:50.040 --> 13:52.710
This happened to me over 20 years ago.

13:52.710 --> 13:54.320
These are ghost scratches.

13:54.320 --> 13:55.710
I didn't pay attention back then.

13:55.710 --> 13:57.920
Then I almost died at the Zhangs'.

13:58.350 --> 13:58.990
Get out of here right now.

13:58.990 --> 13:59.990
Or I'll report you to the authorities.

13:59.990 --> 14:00.350
Get out.

14:00.350 --> 14:01.320
Li Ling!

14:01.320 --> 14:03.320
Maybe I should have the authorities
throw you in jail.

14:03.320 --> 14:04.470
Let's see how they can marry you there!

14:04.470 --> 14:05.440
Aunt!

14:14.630 --> 14:15.590
Master,

14:15.990 --> 14:17.200
please forgive us.

14:17.870 --> 14:18.800
It's fine.

14:19.070 --> 14:19.900
Please.

14:36.160 --> 14:38.400
Listen well, you evil spirits!

14:38.510 --> 14:41.320
The Boundless Heavenly Lord is here today.

14:41.800 --> 14:43.800
Dare not harm the innocent again.

14:43.990 --> 14:46.080
If you dare to come again,

14:46.280 --> 14:48.920
I will ask the Celestial Master

14:49.040 --> 14:52.200
to scatter your souls himself.

15:33.110 --> 15:35.750
Lord of the Red Feather!

15:49.620 --> 15:50.530
You may rise.

15:52.960 --> 15:53.830
Ma'am,

15:53.990 --> 15:56.120
have any strangers visited recently?

15:56.160 --> 15:56.990
No,

15:57.440 --> 15:58.360
absolutely not.

15:58.360 --> 16:01.150
Any movement from the Zhang family?

16:01.440 --> 16:02.630
They are preparing for the wedding.

16:02.630 --> 16:04.750
A lot of people are coming and going.

16:04.920 --> 16:06.780
They didn't come looking for you?

16:07.470 --> 16:08.350
Master,

16:10.510 --> 16:11.560
do you think

16:11.680 --> 16:13.280
the Zhang family did this?

16:13.630 --> 16:14.630
The Zhang family?

16:17.770 --> 16:22.040
[Zhang Residence]

17:16.030 --> 17:16.960
Where is he?

17:17.990 --> 17:19.599
Where did he go?

17:27.839 --> 17:28.840
What's going on?

17:29.600 --> 17:30.710
What's going on?

17:44.070 --> 17:45.030
Liang.

17:47.400 --> 17:48.470
Liang.

17:49.840 --> 17:50.840
Xijiao?

17:50.930 --> 17:52.140
Liang.

17:52.230 --> 17:53.270
Xijiao.

17:53.510 --> 17:54.470
Xijiao.

17:54.790 --> 17:55.640
Liang,

17:55.790 --> 17:56.360
what's wrong?

17:56.360 --> 17:57.960
I missed you so much, Xijiao.

17:58.200 --> 17:59.470
Liang?

17:59.470 --> 18:00.200
Xijiao...

18:00.200 --> 18:01.360
Liang, what's wrong?

18:01.360 --> 18:02.230
Xijiao...

18:02.600 --> 18:03.680
Wake up!

18:03.920 --> 18:05.310
Liang, wake up!

18:05.310 --> 18:05.750
Xijiao...

18:05.750 --> 18:06.680
Liang!

18:06.750 --> 18:07.510
Xijiao.

18:07.880 --> 18:09.790
Liang, wake up!

18:09.960 --> 18:11.400
You've been drugged!

18:11.710 --> 18:13.070
Liang, wake up!

18:13.070 --> 18:14.310
Liang!

18:14.400 --> 18:15.470
No, no, no!

18:15.470 --> 18:16.550
Liang!

18:16.680 --> 18:17.400
Liang!

18:17.650 --> 18:18.120
Liang...

18:18.120 --> 18:18.840
Xijiao.

18:18.840 --> 18:19.440
Liang!

18:19.440 --> 18:21.160
Xijiao.

18:21.860 --> 18:22.580
Xijiao.

18:22.960 --> 18:24.690
Liang, are you feeling better?

18:24.750 --> 18:25.310
Liang.

18:26.400 --> 18:27.000
Xijiao...

18:44.710 --> 18:45.400
Liang.

18:45.470 --> 18:46.600
My chest is so tight.

18:46.620 --> 18:47.820
I feel like I'm dying.

18:48.400 --> 18:49.270
I can't breathe.

18:49.270 --> 18:49.880
Liang!

18:50.100 --> 18:51.230
-I can't breathe.
-Liang.

18:51.230 --> 18:53.360
I'm burning up.

18:58.070 --> 18:58.880
Xijiao.

19:00.070 --> 19:00.920
Xijiao...

19:01.530 --> 19:03.150
[Liu Xijiao]

19:02.160 --> 19:03.030
Xijiao...

19:04.270 --> 19:05.160
Xijiao...

19:06.750 --> 19:08.120
I miss you so much.

19:30.400 --> 19:31.230
What are you hiding?

19:31.230 --> 19:32.110
Nothing.

19:40.440 --> 19:41.470
Let me see.

19:43.600 --> 19:46.470
I just wrote it randomly.

19:50.440 --> 19:52.240
I was just saying that casually.

19:52.470 --> 19:54.600
You're actually learning to write it?

19:54.640 --> 19:56.230
What did you bring me?

20:03.830 --> 20:05.170
You managed to write "Liu" and "Jiao,"

20:05.170 --> 20:07.280
the two difficult characters.

20:07.790 --> 20:09.510
Why can't you write "Xi"?

20:09.960 --> 20:11.510
I learned the hard ones first.

20:11.510 --> 20:13.120
From hard to easy.

20:13.380 --> 20:15.110
This pig trotter is delicious.

20:16.030 --> 20:16.880
How about I teach you?

20:16.880 --> 20:17.510
Okay.

20:21.070 --> 20:22.070
Look.

20:22.200 --> 20:24.470
First there's a heart.

20:24.960 --> 20:27.600
And on the right, there's a house.

20:29.470 --> 20:31.200
Then a "sun" at the bottom.

20:33.270 --> 20:34.640
Got it!

20:35.920 --> 20:37.030
It means

20:37.600 --> 20:38.880
the two of us,

20:39.310 --> 20:40.440
of one mind,

20:40.440 --> 20:42.200
moving into a house

20:42.510 --> 20:44.200
and living together.

20:46.070 --> 20:46.680
Right?

20:51.360 --> 20:53.620
I can't help you if you can't remember it.

20:54.160 --> 20:55.840
I won't be able to teach you
in the future.

20:55.840 --> 20:56.880
Why?

21:01.750 --> 21:02.990
I'm getting married.

21:07.290 --> 21:08.490
Who are you marrying?

21:09.270 --> 21:10.460
They didn't tell me.

21:11.750 --> 21:13.400
The sect arranged it all.

21:13.480 --> 21:15.890
They said he's quite old,

21:16.120 --> 21:17.780
but his family has some money.

21:18.160 --> 21:21.030
The sect must have sold me
for a good price.

21:25.550 --> 21:26.710
I've made some money,

21:26.710 --> 21:27.990
enough to buy a sow,

21:27.990 --> 21:29.270
but not enough for a boar yet.

21:29.270 --> 21:30.710
But I know where they sell them.

21:30.710 --> 21:31.960
Then I'll mate them,

21:31.960 --> 21:33.310
and they'll have a bunch of piglets,

21:33.310 --> 21:34.790
so we can make more money.

21:34.790 --> 21:36.470
Stay in the sect and work hard.

21:37.120 --> 21:38.800
Save more of your earnings.

21:42.520 --> 21:43.780
You'll definitely...

21:47.800 --> 21:51.660
You'll definitely find a better woman
than me to be your wife someday.

22:04.640 --> 22:05.550
That's true.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.310
With my current skills,

22:10.550 --> 22:12.310
I can't even afford pig trotters.

22:12.310 --> 22:13.640
At least the man you're going to marry

22:13.640 --> 22:14.310
is rich.

22:14.790 --> 22:16.350
He can buy you trotters

22:16.960 --> 22:18.750
and give you a good life.

22:29.710 --> 22:31.910
Let's both take good care of ourselves.

22:54.580 --> 22:55.840
Take care of yourself.

22:59.350 --> 23:01.810
[Liu Xijiao]

23:02.420 --> 23:05.470
[Liang]

23:12.030 --> 23:12.880
You're awake?

23:13.550 --> 23:14.790
Why are you here?

23:14.840 --> 23:16.040
Good thing I was here.

23:16.160 --> 23:16.990
The poison you got

23:16.990 --> 23:18.440
could only be cleansed with water.

23:18.440 --> 23:19.400
How is it?

23:19.680 --> 23:20.640
Feeling better?

23:20.640 --> 23:21.600
Much better.

23:21.900 --> 23:23.940
I was set up by that guy.

23:28.160 --> 23:29.070
Leave now.

23:29.200 --> 23:30.030
Didn't I say

23:30.060 --> 23:32.200
I was going to make money on my own
this time?

23:32.200 --> 23:33.920
I just saved you.

23:34.200 --> 23:35.360
And now

23:35.640 --> 23:38.370
you're telling me to leave
the moment you wake up?

23:38.710 --> 23:40.070
But seriously, Liang.

23:40.650 --> 23:41.990
You really have a girlfriend

23:41.990 --> 23:43.230
named Liu Xijiao?

23:43.820 --> 23:46.020
I heard you muttering her name just now.

23:46.120 --> 23:48.070
My love is already dead.

23:48.840 --> 23:50.700
There's nothing to mutter about.

23:51.750 --> 23:53.510
You didn't just mutter about Liu Xijiao.

23:53.510 --> 23:54.970
You muttered about me too.

23:55.270 --> 23:56.470
You said something...

23:56.470 --> 23:57.710
about a coffin.

23:58.920 --> 24:00.120
What else did I say?

24:00.310 --> 24:01.680
You said everything—

24:01.710 --> 24:04.110
things you should and shouldn't have said.

24:07.360 --> 24:09.030
Well, I...

24:09.060 --> 24:10.140
Let me ask you,

24:10.400 --> 24:12.460
are you really the Sect Master's son?

24:14.880 --> 24:15.270
I...

24:15.270 --> 24:16.000
Don't say it!

24:16.350 --> 24:17.550
I have a loose tongue.

24:18.400 --> 24:19.640
Whether you are or not,

24:19.640 --> 24:21.160
you're still my brother.

24:22.440 --> 24:23.920
Let me tell you the truth.

24:24.310 --> 24:25.120
The Sect Master found

24:25.120 --> 24:26.750
Shangguan Chengming's coffin somewhere.

24:26.750 --> 24:27.880
So he suspects you're not his son.

24:27.880 --> 24:29.440
Then he set up a trap for you.

24:29.440 --> 24:30.840
I didn't want you to get involved,

24:30.840 --> 24:31.680
so I tried to stop you from coming.

24:31.680 --> 24:32.740
Do you understand?

24:34.650 --> 24:37.040
This is Shangguan Chengming's coffin.

24:37.230 --> 24:39.990
The Sect Master got it last night.

24:39.990 --> 24:42.650
Since the coffin
arrived at the sect last night,

24:42.730 --> 24:44.190
why hasn't the Sect Master

24:44.510 --> 24:46.160
sent anyone to find me yet?

24:46.310 --> 24:48.110
He is the Sect Master, after all.

24:49.680 --> 24:51.360
While you were setting a trap for him,

24:51.360 --> 24:53.880
he was actually setting one for you.

24:54.160 --> 24:55.710
The Sect Master often says

24:56.030 --> 24:57.750
that everyone has a weakness.

24:58.120 --> 24:59.440
Grasping their weakness

24:59.440 --> 25:00.780
is equivalent to

25:00.800 --> 25:02.330
having leverage over them.

25:02.350 --> 25:03.740
Do you have a weakness?

25:05.880 --> 25:06.840
I don't.

25:08.230 --> 25:10.690
How are things between you
and Jiang Feiyan?

25:14.120 --> 25:14.920
Liang,

25:15.930 --> 25:17.260
since I'm here,

25:17.500 --> 25:18.650
I won't leave.

25:20.230 --> 25:21.750
Nor will I abandon you.

25:23.710 --> 25:24.750
My good brother.

25:26.440 --> 25:27.230
Oh, right.

25:28.070 --> 25:28.880
That master

25:29.310 --> 25:30.370
is no ordinary man.

25:30.550 --> 25:32.510
It seems what happened to the Li family

25:32.510 --> 25:34.710
was indeed related to the Zhang family.

25:35.160 --> 25:37.030
Then where did this master go?

25:37.710 --> 25:38.770
But why do you think

25:38.880 --> 25:40.920
he came to this wilderness?

25:48.230 --> 25:49.230
Mountain peaks rise in a chain,

25:49.230 --> 25:50.960
with clouds winding around their waists

25:50.960 --> 25:53.750
and a clear stream
meandering through the valleys—

25:53.750 --> 25:55.610
this is a land with good feng shui.

25:57.160 --> 25:58.270
Feng shui

25:58.270 --> 25:59.600
is about wind and water.

26:00.750 --> 26:01.790
Can you walk now?

26:01.880 --> 26:03.070
No problem.

26:03.310 --> 26:03.920
Let's go.

26:04.360 --> 26:05.760
Let's check downstream.

26:26.160 --> 26:27.440
Li Ling?

26:27.510 --> 26:28.440
Li Ling?

26:29.070 --> 26:30.800
She's Mrs. Li's niece, I think.

26:30.820 --> 26:31.470
Get out of here right now.

26:31.470 --> 26:32.470
Or I'll report you to the authorities.

26:32.470 --> 26:32.840
Get out.

26:32.840 --> 26:33.750
Li Ling!

26:33.750 --> 26:35.840
Maybe I should have the authorities
throw you in jail.

26:35.840 --> 26:36.960
Let's see how they can marry you there!

26:36.960 --> 26:38.160
Aunt!

26:39.730 --> 26:43.390
This paper figure looks like the work
of the sect's spiritual con.

26:43.790 --> 26:44.990
When I was performing the ritual
at the Li family...

26:44.990 --> 26:45.440
Master.

26:45.440 --> 26:46.160
I found that Mrs. Li

26:46.160 --> 26:47.560
wasn't that crazy.

26:47.580 --> 26:48.510
Oh, right.

26:48.990 --> 26:49.840
You were right about one thing.

26:49.840 --> 26:51.160
It really was a bug.

26:51.750 --> 26:54.410
Could it be someone from the sect
running a scam?

26:59.270 --> 27:02.330
Could it be a misunderstanding
between our own people?

27:05.760 --> 27:07.600
This is the Zhang family's ancestral tomb.

27:07.600 --> 27:10.000
Maybe it's really a soul-trapping ritual.

27:10.380 --> 27:11.340
Liang.

27:13.710 --> 27:15.790
[Xijiao]

27:17.770 --> 27:18.530
Liang.

27:24.710 --> 27:25.920
Liu Xi...

27:28.960 --> 27:29.680
L-Liang...

27:30.160 --> 27:31.230
Liang!

27:31.260 --> 27:31.920
Liang, are you going?

27:31.920 --> 27:32.990
I'm going to the Zhang family to ask them!

27:32.990 --> 27:34.030
Liang! Liang!

27:34.030 --> 27:34.960
Listen to me!

27:34.960 --> 27:35.990
If you rush over there recklessly,

27:35.990 --> 27:37.470
you won't get any answers.

27:37.500 --> 27:38.310
Didn't you tell me?

27:38.310 --> 27:39.360
This trap is aimed at me.

27:39.360 --> 27:40.470
Calm down first.

27:40.910 --> 27:41.950
Li Yingjuan...

27:42.550 --> 27:44.360
Li Yingjuan should know a lot
about the Zhang family.

27:44.360 --> 27:45.640
Let's go find her and ask for details.

27:45.640 --> 27:46.920
Every wrong has its cause,
and every debt has its debtor.

27:46.920 --> 27:48.840
If this is really related
to the Zhang family,

27:48.840 --> 27:50.120
I'll help you

27:50.470 --> 27:51.880
without you even asking.

27:56.310 --> 27:57.160
Ma'am,

27:57.270 --> 27:59.330
what exactly is this soul-trapping?

28:00.230 --> 28:01.070
Ma'am!

28:15.640 --> 28:16.500
She's not dead.

28:16.920 --> 28:18.050
She just passed out.

28:18.990 --> 28:20.250
Shangguan Chengming.

28:24.600 --> 28:25.790
I knew you'd come.

28:26.160 --> 28:29.820
The master the Zhang family hired
is actually you, Second Master?

28:31.750 --> 28:32.680
Big Teapot.

28:33.600 --> 28:35.710
You're still tough as nails.

28:35.740 --> 28:38.220
My poison didn't even take you down.

28:38.550 --> 28:41.120
Looks like I went too easy on you.

28:41.920 --> 28:42.710
What?

28:43.200 --> 28:44.200
Are you mad?

28:44.710 --> 28:46.970
You're not even greeting your grandmaster?

28:46.970 --> 28:47.760
Tell you what.

28:47.760 --> 28:49.200
I'll apologize to you.

28:53.120 --> 28:54.470
I'm talking to you.

28:55.960 --> 28:57.090
Cat got your tongue?

28:57.840 --> 28:58.750
Silly Liang.

29:03.120 --> 29:03.990
Second Master.

29:08.840 --> 29:12.390
These days,
any kind of trash can join the sect.

29:13.920 --> 29:16.380
You have quite the appetite,
Second Master.

29:16.440 --> 29:18.230
From the Zhangs to the Lis.

29:19.710 --> 29:21.600
Is one family not enough for you?

29:21.600 --> 29:22.750
You know nothing.

29:23.200 --> 29:24.640
This is a double-sided scam.

29:24.640 --> 29:27.550
It's just playing both sides for profit.

29:27.780 --> 29:28.960
What's so hard to understand?

29:28.960 --> 29:32.040
This scam was passed down
by the old Sect Master.

29:32.300 --> 29:32.990
The current Sect Master

29:32.990 --> 29:34.990
became the Sect Master

29:35.160 --> 29:37.200
because he took on this scam.

29:37.230 --> 29:39.270
Then I should congratulate you,
Second Master.

29:39.270 --> 29:40.880
If this double-sided scam is so important,

29:40.880 --> 29:43.230
why did the Li family come to me?

29:43.880 --> 29:45.470
This double-sided scam

29:45.880 --> 29:46.960
requires killing.

29:50.600 --> 29:51.730
Do you have the guts?

29:53.960 --> 29:55.230
Greenhorn.

29:56.990 --> 29:59.190
To perform this soul-trapping ritual,

29:59.750 --> 30:02.230
you need to stuff a living person

30:02.790 --> 30:04.920
into a water vat.

30:06.310 --> 30:07.470
And then,

30:07.600 --> 30:08.840
you drown her...

30:10.840 --> 30:11.970
with your own hands.

30:12.920 --> 30:13.990
Fifty years ago,

30:14.590 --> 30:16.890
the Li family kept making things difficult
for our old Sect Master.

30:16.890 --> 30:17.720
Seal the soul.

30:17.960 --> 30:18.920
He had no choice

30:18.950 --> 30:21.870
but to use the soul-trapping ritual.

30:25.030 --> 30:26.200
All these years,

30:26.280 --> 30:29.030
it wasn't just Miss Zhang's soul
that was trapped, right?

30:29.030 --> 30:29.990
The Zhang family

30:30.440 --> 30:31.440
and the Li family—

30:31.840 --> 30:33.320
both families have shed
quite a lot of blood.

30:33.320 --> 30:36.450
This soul-trapping ritual
actually worked every time?

30:36.640 --> 30:38.430
Ever since the first time
it was performed,

30:38.430 --> 30:40.710
the Li family's eldest son, Li Yingfu,

30:41.030 --> 30:43.600
has risen through the ranks
and landed a government position.

30:43.600 --> 30:45.070
As long as it works once,

30:45.160 --> 30:46.440
everyone will think

30:46.510 --> 30:48.310
it's all thanks to
the soul-trapping ritual.

30:48.310 --> 30:50.840
The Zhang family was jealous
of the Li family.

30:52.160 --> 30:54.020
The wicked prey on the destitute.

30:54.790 --> 30:58.550
The Zhang family also asked the Sect Master
to perform the soul-trapping ritual.

30:58.550 --> 31:00.400
So he conveniently turned

31:00.400 --> 31:03.270
the soul-trapping rituals of both families

31:03.400 --> 31:04.860
into a double-sided scam.

31:06.120 --> 31:07.250
The old Sect Master—

31:07.600 --> 31:08.400
I respect him.

31:08.470 --> 31:10.230
But our current Sect Master

31:10.880 --> 31:12.120
is quite something.

31:13.160 --> 31:16.030
He made the Zhang and Li families,
who were once close,

31:16.030 --> 31:17.470
grow suspicious of,

31:17.600 --> 31:18.840
envious of,

31:18.840 --> 31:20.400
and hateful toward each other.

31:20.400 --> 31:21.840
The desires in their hearts

31:21.840 --> 31:23.790
are like algae at the bottom of a river,

31:23.790 --> 31:25.310
tangling tighter and tighter.

31:25.310 --> 31:28.440
The more they hate each other,
the more the sect profits.

31:29.070 --> 31:30.470
I'm just curious about one thing.

31:30.470 --> 31:32.550
This soul-trapping scam
has lasted for 50 years.

31:32.550 --> 31:34.750
The Zhang and Li families
have trapped so many girls.

31:34.750 --> 31:36.440
Has there never been any trouble?

31:36.440 --> 31:37.310
Good question.

31:37.840 --> 31:38.680
Today,

31:38.790 --> 31:40.750
I'll explain it to you in detail.

31:41.960 --> 31:43.680
Actually, it's not just the girls

31:43.680 --> 31:46.880
from the Zhang and Li families
who were trapped.

31:47.000 --> 31:47.890
There are also

31:47.920 --> 31:50.070
the girls from Yuehaitang.

31:51.580 --> 31:54.300
Speaking of which,
I feel sorry for those girls.

31:54.560 --> 31:56.430
Such beautiful girls,

31:56.530 --> 32:00.930
yet their lives are worth less than the dogs
used for spiritual cons in the sect.

32:01.470 --> 32:02.990
Sometimes I think

32:03.510 --> 32:04.880
the Fifth Batou

32:04.940 --> 32:07.110
is really ruthless.

32:07.680 --> 32:08.880
They were all...

32:09.270 --> 32:09.710
Silly Liang!

32:09.710 --> 32:10.970
Shangguan Chengming!

32:11.120 --> 32:11.920
Is he crazy?

32:11.950 --> 32:12.830
I'm telling you,

32:12.830 --> 32:14.030
keep an eye on him!

32:14.230 --> 32:16.400
This case is the legacy
of our Tianxiang Sect.

32:16.400 --> 32:17.790
If you dare to make a move against it,

32:17.790 --> 32:20.120
the Sect Master will definitely kill you.

32:22.920 --> 32:23.840
Jiang Feiyan!

32:26.960 --> 32:27.990
Jiang Feiyan!

32:28.990 --> 32:31.030
Jiang Feiyan, come out here!

32:32.030 --> 32:32.840
Jiang Feiyan!

32:32.920 --> 32:34.050
Why are you yelling?

32:34.710 --> 32:35.680
Jiang Feiyan,

32:35.880 --> 32:37.120
you jinx!

32:37.150 --> 32:38.300
Liang!

32:38.400 --> 32:40.550
You watched our brothers and sisters
in the sect die without doing anything!

32:40.550 --> 32:42.600
Did the blood wine you drank at the altar
mean nothing to you?

32:42.600 --> 32:43.750
Calm down, Liang!

32:43.750 --> 32:44.880
I can't calm down!

32:45.270 --> 32:47.650
The woman I love died
an unexplained death,

32:47.650 --> 32:48.880
and it was all because of her!

32:48.880 --> 32:50.540
What are you going crazy over?

32:51.160 --> 32:52.560
What is he talking about?

32:52.650 --> 32:54.400
Was there a girl named Liu Xijiao

32:54.400 --> 32:56.030
in Yuehaitang before?

32:59.680 --> 33:01.140
Yes, there was such a girl.

33:01.200 --> 33:03.020
And there were Lin Wan'er, Song Xue'e,

33:03.020 --> 33:04.300
and many others.

33:04.510 --> 33:05.600
It was all the sect's arrangement.

33:05.600 --> 33:07.660
You used them all for soul-trapping?

33:08.510 --> 33:09.400
That's right.

33:09.680 --> 33:11.630
I handled every single one of them myself.

33:11.630 --> 33:13.280
What right do you have to act up here?

33:13.280 --> 33:14.170
Get out of here.

33:14.930 --> 33:16.000
You're too ruthless!

33:16.000 --> 33:16.810
Liang!

33:26.600 --> 33:29.130
How are things
on the Zhang family's side now?

33:29.680 --> 33:32.480
The wedding and the ritual
have all been prepared.

33:33.600 --> 33:36.060
Shangguan Chengming is already
in the game.

33:36.960 --> 33:38.790
You need to teach him a good lesson.

33:38.790 --> 33:39.270
Yes.

33:39.640 --> 33:41.210
But with you at the Zhang family,

33:41.210 --> 33:42.270
I can rest assured.

33:45.120 --> 33:45.710
By the way,

33:45.710 --> 33:47.640
I found a little something for you.

33:49.160 --> 33:49.960
A Xuande Jar?

33:50.840 --> 33:52.880
It's in better condition
than yours, right?

33:52.880 --> 33:53.270
Yes,

33:53.710 --> 33:54.910
much better, Master.

33:56.200 --> 33:56.790
Master,

33:56.900 --> 33:58.790
you're the only one who'd remember

33:58.790 --> 34:00.070
such a little thing for me.

34:00.070 --> 34:01.790
I really love it.

34:02.200 --> 34:03.600
Then keep it and enjoy it.

34:06.360 --> 34:07.490
Sixth Batou is here.

34:07.640 --> 34:09.130
Then I'll take my leave first, Master.

34:09.130 --> 34:09.659
Alright.

34:15.340 --> 34:16.030
Master.

34:22.110 --> 34:24.770
Shangguan Chengming went
to find Jiang Feiyan.

34:26.360 --> 34:28.239
Now that all the players are here,

34:28.460 --> 34:30.100
the show can begin.

34:36.340 --> 34:38.000
[Zhang Residence]

34:43.290 --> 34:44.969
[Zhang Yinhua]

34:45.989 --> 34:48.239
Here they come!

34:49.190 --> 34:51.440
Congratulations!

34:52.440 --> 34:55.510
Master, the Young Master is here!

34:55.020 --> 34:57.210
[Zhang Yuanfan]

34:55.510 --> 34:56.800
Congratulations!

35:18.760 --> 35:20.420
First bow to Heaven and Earth!

35:22.110 --> 35:23.570
Second bow to the parents!

35:25.990 --> 35:27.990
Husband and wife, bow to each other!

35:31.110 --> 35:32.970
The newlyweds will now serve tea!

35:56.840 --> 35:58.440
Congratulations, Master Zhang.

35:58.440 --> 35:59.800
Congratulations!

35:59.850 --> 36:01.710
Congratulations, Master Zhang!

36:13.550 --> 36:15.210
When you get to the other side,

36:15.710 --> 36:17.910
I will burn plenty of joss paper for you.

36:19.280 --> 36:21.070
You must also bless our family

36:21.550 --> 36:23.110
with wealth, glory,

36:23.800 --> 36:25.510
happiness, and longevity.

37:11.010 --> 37:11.810
Seal the soul!

38:07.070 --> 38:08.160
The ritual is complete.

38:08.160 --> 38:09.490
Congratulations, Master Zhang.

38:09.490 --> 38:11.690
You've gained another 10 years of life.

38:18.920 --> 38:20.240
I'm recovered.

38:22.190 --> 38:23.510
I can feel it.

38:24.630 --> 38:25.990
I can feel it!

38:36.210 --> 38:38.000
[Li Ling]

38:38.950 --> 38:41.620
[Li Residence]

39:05.990 --> 39:07.200
For this scam to work,

39:07.630 --> 39:10.090
the ritual needs to look like
it's complete.

39:10.440 --> 39:12.640
So those girls have to be put in the vats.

39:13.960 --> 39:15.420
Because the fools who paid

39:15.760 --> 39:17.690
will check if they are really dead.

39:17.890 --> 39:18.600
As for

39:18.630 --> 39:19.630
the soul-trapping nails,

39:19.630 --> 39:22.030
they are fake ones I had
the Fourth Batou make in advance.

39:22.030 --> 39:23.830
Nailing them in won't kill them.

39:23.920 --> 39:24.990
We just need to fool those people first.

39:24.990 --> 39:26.190
So that means

39:27.150 --> 39:28.630
Liu Xijiao is still alive.

39:28.800 --> 39:29.800
Where is she?

39:30.150 --> 39:31.150
Even if I tell you,

39:32.320 --> 39:33.920
you can't go looking for her.

39:34.190 --> 39:36.360
According to the rules
of the Tianxiang Sect,

39:36.360 --> 39:37.760
you should know very well

39:37.990 --> 39:40.050
how they will treat me and those girls

39:40.400 --> 39:41.660
who have left the sect,

39:42.720 --> 39:44.320
and what will happen to them.

39:44.470 --> 39:45.070
So,

39:46.880 --> 39:49.210
you've been saving these girls all along?

39:51.960 --> 39:53.760
These girls have had a hard life.

39:53.800 --> 39:54.800
Someone has to

39:55.470 --> 39:57.330
shield them from some disasters.

39:58.280 --> 39:59.150
However...

40:00.630 --> 40:02.290
how did you end up in this scam?

40:05.360 --> 40:06.560
It's the Sect Master.

40:14.070 --> 40:14.470
Yanzi,

40:14.880 --> 40:16.010
where have you been?

40:16.190 --> 40:17.550
I was worried about Shangguan Chengming

40:17.550 --> 40:18.630
being involved in the scam.

40:18.630 --> 40:20.760
With you gone, I felt even more uneasy.

40:21.240 --> 40:23.150
What are you saying, Second Master?

40:23.150 --> 40:25.950
I just went to prepare
some dishes for your drinks.

40:27.510 --> 40:28.840
You're the best to me.

40:43.470 --> 40:44.280
Yanzi,

40:44.550 --> 40:46.470
if we could be

40:46.470 --> 40:47.190
of one mind

40:47.800 --> 40:49.070
from now on,

40:49.470 --> 40:51.470
imagine how good our meals would be.

40:53.720 --> 40:54.550
Just eat.

41:11.280 --> 41:11.990
Master!

41:21.320 --> 41:22.250
Have some water.

41:27.630 --> 41:28.490
Master, you...

41:31.760 --> 41:34.030
The ritual has just been completed.

41:36.280 --> 41:37.550
Why is my health

41:38.110 --> 41:40.070
getting worse?

41:40.240 --> 41:40.720
Well...

42:09.880 --> 42:10.470
Master!

42:13.510 --> 42:14.070
Master!

42:15.240 --> 42:15.990
Where is she?

42:16.470 --> 42:17.440
Where is Li Ling?

42:17.440 --> 42:17.960
Well...

42:18.840 --> 42:19.590
I'll go

42:19.590 --> 42:21.400
bring that witch over here right now!

42:21.400 --> 42:22.320
Follow me!

42:36.320 --> 42:36.980
Who are you?

42:37.190 --> 42:38.770
How dare you brandish weapons
in Zhang Residence?

42:38.770 --> 42:39.850
Cut the crap.

42:40.070 --> 42:41.200
Take her away!

42:41.300 --> 42:42.300
Don't touch her!

42:44.360 --> 42:45.400
Catch them!

42:54.280 --> 42:55.140
Second Master!

42:59.630 --> 43:00.490
Take them away.

43:01.550 --> 43:02.150
Move!

43:02.400 --> 43:02.750
Hurry up!

43:02.750 --> 43:03.360
Move!

43:07.590 --> 43:08.240
Here.

43:08.670 --> 43:09.760
Have some water.

43:10.110 --> 43:11.190
Don't worry.

43:11.190 --> 43:11.990
Once the boat arrives

43:11.990 --> 43:13.400
and Chengming settles things
with the captain,

43:13.400 --> 43:15.000
we'll get you out of Yucheng.

43:17.960 --> 43:18.960
It will be fine.

43:19.840 --> 43:20.770
Have some water.

43:53.160 --> 43:55.470
[In the next episode]

43:55.540 --> 43:57.630
What are you doing, Second Master?

43:58.760 --> 43:59.900
With that brat around,

43:59.900 --> 44:01.280
he'll drag you down with him
sooner or later.

44:01.280 --> 44:02.140
Second Master!

44:02.360 --> 44:04.280
Jiang Feiyan saved Li Ling?

44:04.360 --> 44:05.640
She exposed the scam.

44:05.680 --> 44:07.210
Between Li Ling and Feiyan,

44:07.310 --> 44:08.940
you can only save one.

44:09.760 --> 44:10.550
Feiyan!

44:11.070 --> 44:11.880
Watch out!

44:14.190 --> 44:14.990
Second Master!

44:14.990 --> 44:16.390
Look carefully! It's me!

44:16.620 --> 44:17.910
Brat!

44:18.400 --> 44:20.130
You're the one I'm here to kill!

44:20.840 --> 44:22.030
Interesting.

44:22.430 --> 44:24.630
When do you think
the fish will take the bait?
